  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Meet the Nike Vomero Plus RR—your new go-to for plush, high-stack comfort on everyday miles. Designed for runners who crave plush cushioning, these shoes feature a full-length ZoomX foam midsole for Nike’s most responsive ride yet. Paired with a breathable engineered mesh upper, these running shoes deliver a cool and soft breathable fit. A super-charged blend of ultra-soft foam and heel Air Zoom units brings that signature Nike pop to every step. Feel the lift, feel the bounce, and feel the difference in the Nike Vomero Plus RR.</p> <p><strong>Nike Vomero Plus RR features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Engineered mesh upper offers soft breathability.</li> <li>Webbed lace loops provide an adjustable fit.</li> <li>Ultra-responsive ZoomX cushioning at the midsole gives maximum comfort.</li> <li>Heel clips give stability.</li> <li>Low-cut collar allows natural ankle movement.</li> <li>High-abrasion waffle shaped rubber outsole delivers long lasting grip.</li> <li>Weight: Approx. 273g/9.6 oz (Men's US 10).</li> <li>Heel-to-toe drop: 10mm.</li> </ul></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero Plus RR - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Metallic Silver/White/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td st